    "sections": {
        "description": "The Electrical Services theme is designed with a clean layout and structured sections for presenting service-related content in an organized way. It includes responsive design support, customizable banner areas, service sections, call-to-action blocks, testimonial display, team showcase, and contact information integration. The theme supports navigation menus, social media links, widgetized areas, and essential customization settings for colors, fonts, and layout adjustments. It is compatible with common plugins and includes optimized code for smooth performance across different screen sizes. The homepage structure allows clear content arrangement with sections for featured services, project highlights, and business information. The theme also provides blog integration, image display options, and footer customization features to maintain a consistent and functional website layout."
    },
